{"id":76546,"title":"03 | 第一章内容概述","content":"本部分旨在从宏观视角重构对 TensorFlow 的认知，超越基础教程层面，深入剖析其诞生背景、核心人物、应用场景及发展现状。内容分为五个维度：首先阐述 TensorFlow 产生的历史必然性，指出其作为 Google 第二代深度学习平台，是特定技术节点演进的产物而非偶然构思，拥有明确的技术前身。其次聚焦关键人物 Jeff Dean，介绍其作为 Google AI 标杆及 TensorFlow 创造者的角色，并梳理其与吴恩达等业界领袖的互动轶事。第三部分系统梳理 TensorFlow 的多元应用场景，展示其作为人工智能核心工具在不同领域的落地能力。第四部分探讨弱电信号处理等具体商业应用，强调 AI 技术在安防、语音识别之外，如何通过实际商业化项目创造经济效益并提升社会运转效率。最后综述 TensorFlow 开源三年多来的演进历程，涵盖社区生态建设、版本迭代特性及当前发展态势。通过这五个层面的解读，为读者提供理解 TensorFlow 的独特视角，厘清其从技术萌芽到生态繁荣的完整脉络。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":146845,"user_name":"李子木","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1244702,"ip_address":"","ucode":"2255568DC32066","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/fe/1e/378ed6bf.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1572674846,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":59093,"content":"谢谢，这个需要咱们平台支持","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"彭靖田","uid":1067283,"ctime":1574310500,"ip_address":"","comment_id":146845,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":2,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100023001,"comment_content":"要是有字幕就好了，开大会的时候可以偷偷看会","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1067283,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/49/13/51b1fe81.jpg","nickname":"彭靖田","note":"","ucode":"D3F1C281F38390","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":473029,"discussion_content":"谢谢，这个需要咱们平台支持","content_length":13,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1574310500,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]},{"author":{"id":2275782,"avatar":"https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/vdnBSyYd0OibibEodjicJax095eFSw5zYt4bjj8pUhOj91tIJ8G28v7YbwfsGXpHxBOlQUTiaTp3FyyLicZxkkXOejQ/132","n